            0.626
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We will solve more interesting problems of this kind in a later chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.643,
            0.449,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A Dramma-tic Donation"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.673,
            0.846,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The following problem is translated from Bhāskarāchārya’s (Bhāskara II’s) book, Līlāvatī, written in 1150 CE."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.713,
            0.848,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“O wise one! A miser gave to a beggar "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 5 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 1 6 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of a dramma. If you know the mathematics of fractions well, tell me O child, how many cowrie shells were given by the miser to the beggar.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.807,
            0.848,
            0.864
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Dramma refers to a silver coin used in those times. The tale says that 1 dramma was equivalent to 1280 cowrie shells. Let’s see what fraction of a dramma the person gave:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.293,
            0.872,
            0.704,
            0.912
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\left( { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } \\times { \\frac { 2 } { 3 } } \\times { \\frac { 3 } { 4 } } \\times { \\frac { 1 } { 5 } } \\times { \\frac { 1 } { 1 6 } } \\times { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } } \\right) ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " part of a dramma."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.806,
            0.937,
            0.848,
            0.955
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "193"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
